msgid ""
":doc:`/how-to/space/load-models-and-tilesets` and :doc:`/how-"
"to/space/georeference-a-study`, for models in the Space."
msgstr ""
":doc:`/how-to/space/load-models-and-tilesets` e :doc:`/how-"
"to/space/georeference-a-study`, per i modelli nello Spazio."

msgid ""
":doc:`/reference/desktop-and-web`, for the file pickers of the two "
"versions."
msgstr ""
":doc:`/reference/desktop-and-web`, per i selettori di file delle due "
"versioni."

